From: Miguel Fuertes <hkfuertes@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:16:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] echo: add --with-echo-controls buttons and LED bridge

Optional bridge from Echo buttons/LED ring (libecho_controls.a) to the ALSA
mixer and AP2 reverse events. Requires --with-echo-alsa. Off unless configured.

Upstream: not applicable (Amazon Echo hardware only)
Signed-off-by: Miguel Fuertes <hkfuertes@users.noreply.github.com>
---
